# Fishing admin abuse events

When the user asks to run a **global** Fishing Idle event — phrases like `2x luck admin abuse`, `2x money admin abuse`, `2x sell admin abuse`, or similar — do this immediately (do not only explain how):

## Preferred (instant): MantleDB POST

```powershell
$now = [DateTimeOffset]::UtcNow.ToUnixTimeMilliseconds()
$until = $now + (5 * 60 * 1000)   # or N minutes
$body = @{
  token = "ice-fish-evt-9f3a"
  kind = "money"   # or "luck"
  until = $until
  startedAt = $now
  note = "admin-abuse"
} | ConvertTo-Json -Compress
Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Uri "https://mantledb.sh/v2/icedragon1st-mygames/fishing-admin-events" -ContentType "application/json" -Body $body
```

Clear early: set `until = 0` (kind can stay luck/money).

## Fallback: Pages JSON

If Mantle fails, write `fishing/admin-event.json` the same shape (no token required) and commit + push.

Default length is **5 minutes** unless the user specifies 1–60.

ICE_DRAGON can also run these from the in-game Menu admin panel. Chat abuse still works so you can trigger without opening the game.

Scheduled :00/:30 events still run; an active admin override replaces them until `until`.
